      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stunned by the Chef's announcement, Max asks what test he is talking about. A series of flashbacks reveals that Viktor Petrovich carefully staged Lyova's sudden vacation and Fedya's refusal to work in order to see how Max would handle running the kitchen in an emergency.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Какую проверку?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "А ты думаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вы же сами заявление подписали.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Я пьяный был?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну, тогда не считается.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Предупреждать надо было.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А я не виноват.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Что вы все время пьяный.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Без тебя актер.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Вечером что был?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ничего не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "У меня планы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф, готово.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Какую проверку?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What test are you talking about?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "А ты думаешь?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you think?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вы же сами заявление подписали.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You signed the request form yourself.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Я пьяный был?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Was I drunk when I signed it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну, тогда не считается.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, then it does not count.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Предупреждать надо было.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You should have warned me beforehand.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А я не виноват.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is not my fault.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Что вы все время пьяный.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That you are drunk all the time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Без тебя актер.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Quite an actor even without you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "Вечером что был?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What happened in the evening?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ничего не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I do not know anything.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "lyova",
      "t": "У меня планы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have plans.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Шеф, готово.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chef, everything is ready.'",
      "gap": 0.65
